            "description_html": "<b>Contemporary Satin Stainless Steel Floor Mounted Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Stainless Steel Floor Mount Door Stop has a contemporary design that makes it perfect for modern spaces. It is easy to install, simply remove the bumper tip and screw directly to a wood surface or to the included anchor. This floor mounted door stop is 2 inches long and has a black rubber tip.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-FDS72750-specification.gif?v=1704354601\" width=\"244\" heigth=\"323\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-FDS72750-630 Satin Stainless Steel Floor Mount Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD-FDS72750-630 Contemporary Door Bumper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Tip: Black</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Diameter: 1-7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper Length: 27-32\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Diameter: 1-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
